{"id":"29eaaec90a48dc6c","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl.md","title":"IL和ILM在一元模态片段上保守","display":"thm-il-conservative-over-gl — IL和ILM在一元模态片段上保守","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl","aliases":["72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl"],"display":"thm-il-conservative-over-gl — IL和ILM在一元模态片段上保守","depends_on":["[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]]","[[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]]","[[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]]","[[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §13 and GL modal completeness §2; complete local conservativity proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-il-conservative-over-gl — IL和ILM在一元模态片段上保守"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"137fba496ea55bfa\" href=\"?note=137fba496ea55bfa\" title=\"72-df-il-ilm-calculi\">72-df-il-ilm-calculi</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f0c9e30e2bea53f4\" href=\"?note=f0c9e30e2bea53f4\" title=\"72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion\">72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de3f2ba1fa9eb703\" href=\"?note=de3f2ba1fa9eb703\" title=\"72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness\">72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d40b90e274cadbda\" href=\"?note=d40b90e274cadbda\" title=\"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness\">72-thm-gl-finite-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §13 and GL modal completeness §2; complete local conservativity proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\)</span>，即 A 不含二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\triangleright\">\\(\\triangleright\\)</span> 构造；三种可证性各使用自身的明确闭包定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\vdash_{\\mathsf{IL}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ILM}}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\vdash_{\\mathsf{IL}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ILM}}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>GL 的所有公理实例及两条闭包规则在 IL 中仍合法，而 IL 的闭包包含于 ILM。反向若 A 非 GL 定理，有限 GL 完备性给有限反模型；给它加 S_R，得到 ILM 框架。对旧语言公式归纳，新增关系 S_R 不改变其真值。于是 ILM 可靠性排除 A 为 ILM 定理。只在不含新联结词的片段比较，不能据此把 IL 与 ILM 整体识别。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-il-ilm-calculi","status":"resolved","id":"137fba496ea55bfa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"f0c9e30e2bea53f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"de3f2ba1fa9eb703","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}","display":false},{"tex":"\\triangleright","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\vdash_{\\mathsf{IL}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ILM}}A.","display":true}],"bytes":1613,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretab